 <div dmwrapped="true" id="dmFirstContainer" class="dmBody u_dmStyle_template_introductie dm-home-page" themewaschanged="true"> <div id="allWrapper" class="allWrapper" data-auto="all-wrapper"><!-- navigation placeholders --> <div id="dm_content" class="dmContent" role="main"> <div dm:templateorder="170" class="dmHomeRespTmpl mainBorder dmRespRowsWrapper dmFullRowRespTmpl" id="1716942098"> <div class="u_1011980758 dmRespRow mobile-columns-reversed hasBackgroundOverlay dmSectionNoParallax" style="text-align: center;" id="1011980758"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1259362107"> <div class="u_1938761192 dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12" id="1938761192"> <div data-element-type="spacer" class="dmSpacer u_1603230428" id="1603230428"></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1344789032" id="1344789032" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s; text-align: center; display: block;" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5"> <h3 class="text-align-center size-48 m-size-38" style="line-height: 2;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;" class="font-size-48 m-font-size-38">WELKOM BIJ ONZE CLUB</span></h3> 
</div></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1622142422 dmRespRow" style="text-align: center;" id="1622142422"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1193995587"> <div class="u_1126523262 dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12" id="1126523262"> <div class="u_1953004841 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1953004841" data-styletopreserve="{"background-image":""}" background-image":""}"=""> <h3 class="text-align-center"><span style="display: initial; color: rgba(255, 135, 0, 0.9);">WE CONNECT - WE PLAY - WE GROW</span></h3> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmDividerWrapper clearfix u_1471572103" data-element-type="dDividerId" data-layout="divider-style-1" data-widget-version="2" id="1471572103"><hr class="dmDivider" style="border-width:2px; border-top-style:solid; color:grey;" id="1491655303"/></div> 
 <div class="u_1921913681 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1921913681" data-styletopreserve="{"background-image":""}" background-image":""}"="" style=""> <h3 class="text-align-center"><span style="display: unset; color: rgb(255, 135, 0);">ONZE KLEUREN - ONS TENUE</span></h3> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1230724975" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-18 text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Oranje-Rood is een TOP hockeyclub met een landelijke uitstraling waar plezier, teamprestatie, ontplooiing op elk niveau en een &eacute;chte clubbeleving centraal staan.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-18 text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Gedurende de 100 jaar van onze club draait het bij Oranje-Rood om verbinding, spelplezier en groei. Die kernwaarden hebben wij vertaald naar</span> 
</span><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial; font-weight: 700;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial; font-weight: 700;">We Connect-We Play-We Grow</span> 
</span><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">en geeft direct aan waar wij als club voor staan: verbinding als basis, waarna via spelplezier groei en ambities waargemaakt kunnen worden.</span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-18 text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Per september 2024 telt de club ruim 2.500 leden waarvan het grootste deel (1.600 leden) in de jeugd speelt. Oranje-Rood biedt hen naast trainingen en deelname aan de diverse&nbsp; bondscompetities een groot scala aan andere hockeyactiviteiten. &nbsp;</span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-left m-size-18" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Meer weten over de club of wat er bv. voor zakelijke of feestelijke activiteiten mogelijk op onze geweldige accommodatie? Neem dan contact op met</span> 
</span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#cda8b5bda1a2a4b9acb9a4a8e3a0aca3acaaa8bf8da5aea2bfaca3a7a8e0bfa2a2a9e3a3a1" target="_blank" type="email" class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ee8b969e8281879a8f9a878bc0838f808f898b9cae868d819c8f80848bc39c81818ac08082">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-left" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-center m-size-18" style="line-height: normal;"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Luister&nbsp;</span><a href="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/files/uploaded/oranje%20rood%201711241900.mp3" target="_blank" runtime_url="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/files/uploaded/oranje%20rood%201711241900.mp3" file="true" type="file" class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">hier</a><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;">&nbsp;naar ons clublied</span></p><p class="text-align-left"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1159633563" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;"><p class="m-size-14 text-align-left size-18"><span class="m-font-size-14 font-size-18" style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;">Thuis-tenue&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="m-font-size-14 font-size-18" style="display: initial; font-weight: 700;">Uit-tenue (alleen topteams)</span></p><p class="m-size-12 text-align-left"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;"><span style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;" class="m-font-size-18">Shirt:</span> 
</span><span style="display: initial;" class="m-font-size-12">oranje-rood met zwarte biezen en zwarte kraag&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;" class="m-font-size-12">Shirt</span><span style="display: initial;" class="m-font-size-12">: wit met oranje en rode biezen en witte kraag</span></p><p class="text-align-left m-size-12"><span class="m-font-size-12" style="font-weight: bold; display: initial;">Broek/rok</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial;"><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial;">: zwart met oranje en rode biezen zijkant&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> 
</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;">Broek/rok</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial;">: wit met oranje en rode biezen zijkant</span></p><p class="text-align-left m-size-12"><span class="m-font-size-12" style="font-weight: bold; display: initial;">Kousen</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial;">: zwart met verticale oranje en rode biezen&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;">Kousen</span><span class="m-font-size-12" style="display: initial;">: wit met verticale oranje en rode biezen</span></p><p class="text-align-left"><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="text-align-left"><span class="" style="display: initial; font-style: italic;"><span style="display: initial; font-style: italic;">Team (kleding) sponsoren? Lees eerst het</span> 
</span><a href="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/files/uploaded/Reglement_team_%28kleding%29_sponsoren.pdf" runtime_url="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/files/uploaded/Reglement_team_%28kleding%29_sponsoren.pdf" type="file" style="display: initial; font-style: italic;" file="true" target="_blank">reglement</a><span class="" style="display: initial; font-style: italic;"> <span style="display: initial; font-style: italic;">goed door!</span></span></p><p class="text-align-center"><span class="m-font-size-18" style="display: initial;"><br/></span><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p></div> 
