 <div class="slide-inner" id="1677396171"> <div class="text-wrapper" id="1237232721"> <h3 class="slide-title u_1135546959" id="1135546959">We Connect</h3> 
 <div class="slide-text richText u_1438106439" id="1438106439"><p class="rteBlock">&quot;Ik hockey een leven lang in een Brabants-gezellige omgeving waar iedereen betrokken is en ik volledig mijzelf kan zijn&quot;</p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="slide-button dmWidget clearfix slide-button-invisible" id="1253612044"> <span class="iconBg" id="1729808034"> <span class="icon hasFontIcon icon-star" id="1018213050"></span> 
</span> 
 <span class="text" id="1077633011">Knop</span> 
</div> 
</div> 
</li> 
 <li layout="center" position="center" animation="fadeInUp" show-content="true" color-overlay="true" text-background="true" id="1669503504" class="u_1669503504" show-caption="true"><img dm="true" src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/dms3rep/multi/opt/DSC_4729-1920w.JPG" id="1083482465" alt="" onerror="handleImageLoadError(this)"/> <div class="color-overlay" id="1588295922"></div> 
 <div class="slide-inner" id="1788068292"> <div class="text-wrapper" id="1255649643"> <h3 class="slide-title u_1285872296" id="1285872296">We Play</h3> 
 <div class="slide-text richText u_1654941278" id="1654941278"><p class="rteBlock">&ldquo;Wij sporten met plezier en met een gezond lijf &amp; geest in een veilige, gezonde en duurzame omgeving&rdquo;</p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="slide-button dmWidget clearfix slide-button-invisible" id="1441578672"> <span class="iconBg" id="1443694569"> <span class="icon hasFontIcon icon-star" id="1209197515"></span> 
</span> 
 <span class="text" id="1732978818">Knop</span> 
</div> 
</div> 
</li> 
 <li layout="center" position="center" animation="fadeInUp" show-content="true" color-overlay="true" text-background="true" id="1434512051" class="u_1434512051" show-caption="true"><img dm="true" src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/3d61c965/dms3rep/multi/opt/pa120161_54849771772_o-1920w.jpg" id="1244298440" alt="" onerror="handleImageLoadError(this)"/> <div class="color-overlay" id="1249127710"></div> 
 <div class="slide-inner" id="1540341980"> <div class="text-wrapper" id="1396841760"> <h3 class="slide-title u_1476290132" id="1476290132">We Grow</h3> 
 <div class="slide-text richText u_1154221331" id="1154221331"><p class="rteBlock">Wij streven continue naar groei voor iedereen (individu, team &amp; club) op hockey en sociaal vlak. Dit doen wij middels opleidingen, innovaties &amp; talentontwikkeling samen met onze sponsors &amp; partners.</p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="slide-button dmWidget clearfix slide-button-invisible" id="1962957836"> <span class="iconBg" id="1202630646"> <span class="icon hasFontIcon icon-star" id="1489812568"></span> 
</span> 
 <span class="text" id="1551942709"></span> 
</div> 
</div> 
</li> 
</ul> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1293522504 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1293522504" data-styletopreserve="{" background-image":""}"=""> <h3 class="text-align-center"><span class="" style="display: unset; color: rgb(255, 135, 0);"><span style="display: unset; color: rgb(255, 135, 0);">WE CONNECT</span> 
</span></h3> 
